    "Critical Power aus Fahrten": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Critical power from rows"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Damit jedes Turnier ein volles Feld hat, füllt RowCoach es mit virtuellen Teilnehmenden auf. Sie sind immer mit ✦ gekennzeichnet – am Boot, in der Rennanzeige, in Ergebnissen und Ranglisten.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "So that every tournament has a full field, RowCoach fills it up with virtual participants. They are always marked with ✦ – on the boat, in the race display, in results and in rankings."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Danach geht es in Woche %lld des Plans weiter.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Afterwards the plan continues in week %lld."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Daraus rechnet RowCoach Pulszonen und Zieltempi. Später änderbar unter Einstellungen.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "RowCoach uses this for heart rate zones and target splits. You can change it later in Settings."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Darstellung": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
